{title: Main Tenu Samjhawa Ki}
{artist: Rahat Fateh Ali Khan}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
Play [D]chord all along
nai jeena, tere baajo nai jeena, nai jeena
nai jeena tere baajo nai jeena, nai jeena,        main tenu sam [A]jhawan [D]ki
na tere baajo [A]lagda [D]ji ],        tu hi jaane [Bm]pyar me [A]ra
main karaan inte [G]zar te [A]ra,        tu dil tu yun [Bm]jaan me [D]ri
main tenu sam [A]jhawan [D]ki,        na tere baajo [A]lagda [D]ji
[D]mere dil vich [Bm]re ke mere,        [G]dil da haal na [D]jaane
[D]tere baajo [Bm]kaleyan be ke,        [G]ronde nain nu [D]mane
jeena me [G]ra Haa [A]ye,        marna me [Em]ra naal te [D]re si
kar aeti [Bm]bar me [A]ra,        main karaan inte [G]zar te [A]ra
tu dil tu yun [Bm]jaan me [D]ri,        main tenu sam [A]jhawan [D]ki
na tere baajo [A]lagda [D]ji,        HOo,oo,o,o
[D]ni changa nai O [Em]kitaa,        [Em]ve changa nai O [A]kitaa
dil [G]mera torr [A]ke,        ve bara pach [Bm]taya akh [A]aan
ve bara pach [G]taya akhaan,        tere [Em]naal jorr [D]ke
[D]sunjiya sunjiyan [Bm]dil diya galiya,        [G]sunjiyan meriyan [D]baawan
[D]aaja teriyan [Bm]khashboo walon,        [G]love diyan meriyan [D]saaman
tere bi [G]na ... [Bm]haaye,        ki main ka [Em]raan door u [D]dasi
dil beq [Bm]rar me [A]ra,        main karaan inte [G]zar te [A]ra
tu dil tu yun [Bm]jaan me [D]ri,        main tenu sam [A]jhawan [D]ki
na tere baajo [A]lagda [D]ji
